  triage:title "release/publish-surface-scope.md still describes the deleted scripts/verify_user_docs.py as the live user-doc freshness gate" ;
  triage:description "AT.2 deleted scripts/verify_user_docs.py and its unreachable calling branch in validate_release.py (RBQA-F001), but release/publish-surface-scope.md:75-76 still states in prose that 'the user-doc freshness gate reuses scripts/verify_user_docs.py rather than maintaining a second partial checker.' AT.2's own prescribed reference-scan command covers only .github/, .just/, Justfile, scripts/, and docs/ — release/ was never in scope, so this dangling reference survived the sprint's own dead-reference sweep. Dual-reported independently by arch-qa (ARCH-001) and req-qa (ATM-QA-RECHECK-002) in QA pass AT2-QA-R1 on PR #1064." ;
